<title>YEMEN: Yemen January foreign reserves $1.16 billion.</title>
<headline>Yemen January foreign reserves $1.16 billion.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Yemen Central Bank's foreign currency reserves climbed to $1.16 billion at the end of January, official figures showed on Saturday.</p>
<p>The bank's statistics bulletin said foreign reserves stood at $1.36 billion at the end of December.</p>
</text>
